(text "FFC60 ADVANCED ACCESSORY - component side, cable through rounded slot\n1..48: ROW / GPIO / GND triplets. Do not bridge ROW to GPIO on an accessory.\n49..52: auxiliary GPIO aliases (UART0 may emit boot logs); 53/54: user I2C.\n55/56 GND; 57 3V3; 58 EXP_RESET_N (LOW = outputs must be disabled); 59/60 5V.\nSTOP/boot: MCU holds ROW_ARM_N HIGH, EXP_RESET_N LOW. Accessory output stages\nmust default OFF and hardware-gate their OE with pin58; independent sources need local gating.\nPower is shared, not isolated: no 5A claim through FFC. No hot-plug guarantee.\nUse short cable; ADC accuracy and digital bandwidth depend on routing/cable/accessory."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e95c675e-a98d-4285-bb54-1046da34bafd")
	)
